# Use the image CMD instead of replacing it with `sleep infinity`.
#
# The Dockerfile CMD boots the Spring Cloud Function app (vulnerable
# spring-cloud-function 3.2.2) in the background and execs `sleep infinity`, so
# the daemon is already running when the agent starts (making "upgraded the jars
# but never restarted" detectable) and PID 1 stays `sleep infinity`. Solutions
# must RESTART the app after upgrading Spring Cloud Function.
